\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we compute the image of $X$ under ${R}_{-\\pi }$ by calculating the matrix product $RX:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}RX & =[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}0 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 & -1 \\\\ -1 & -2 & -2\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the coordinates of the respective vertices of ${S}^{′}$ are $(0,-1),(1,-2),(-1,-2).$\n\nSo, the correct answer is \"II only.\"" 13194139535264 true] [17592186340539 1000 #edb/ref 17592186340540 13194139535264 true] [17592186340539 1000 #edb/ref 17592186340541 13194139535264 true] [17592186340539 1000 #edb/ref 17592186340542 13194139535264 true] [17592186340539 1000 #edb/ref 17592186340543 13194139535264 true] [17592186340539 1000 #edb/ref 17592186340544 13194139535264 true] [17592186340539 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535264 true] [17592186340539 1041 "selection" 13194139535264 true] [17592186340539 1104 #edb/ref 17592186340544 13194139535264 true] [17592186340539 1110 #uuid "49fa144a-3c70-5a3b-9557-fa8a06f32ddc" 13194139535264 true] [17592186340540 1034 "II and III only" 13194139535264 true] [17592186340540 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535264 true] [17592186340540 1111 #uuid "56ed4fb2-6ca8-5427-bb9d-c7dd672b8f55" 13194139535264 true] [17592186340541 1034 "I only" 13194139535264 true] [17592186340541 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535264 true] [17592186340541 1111 #uuid "778ffe8a-f23f-5c9d-a590-f5fdfb863a7d" 13194139535264 true] [17592186340542 1034 "III only" 13194139535264 true] [17592186340542 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535264 true] [17592186340542 1111 #uuid "f9229348-5460-5150-a5d9-a08d56ffb446" 13194139535264 true] [17592186340543 1034 "I and II only" 13194139535264 true] [17592186340543 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535264 true] [17592186340543 1111 #uuid "a0e97555-0c10-5f07-ad6c-9a2f4917ac28" 13194139535264 true] [17592186340544 1034 "II only" 1319413953526